        "description": "***Includes cross-buy on Rift!**\n\nChallenge your friends in a PvP VR Horror game 👻\n\nFeel the thrill of a hunt in a 1v1 Duel or up to 1v3 Hide and Seek mode that will push your wits, perceptiveness, and courage to their very limits 😱 Employ a wide array of items, triggers, and skills tailored to your class to outsmart and defeat your adversary - a terrifying, lifeforce-draining Ghost or a dauntless, vigilant Hunter. All of this set in spine-chilling locations such as a haunted Mansion, Mines, or a horrid Orphanage.\n\nFeatures:\n\n• Meta Quest x PCVR Crossplay \n\n• Challenge your friends in a spooky horror PvP system with 1v1 and up to 1v3 modes {3856821484549122}\n\n• Two unique classes with dedicated skills and items {1277364309966972}\n• A suspenseful vibe of psychological horror {516275671402500}\n• Haunted locations abound with possibilities and usable environment elements {553393677627721}\n• Skins to customize your favorite character {2071028476663707}\n• Events and updates with new content to the game\n",
